/**
 * @defgroup fake_stream fake stream
 * @ingroup test_support_reference
 *
 * @brief Test double support for `stream`.
 *
 * @details
 * Provides reusable test support for constructing and configuring `stream`
 * instances backed by fake stream adapters.
 *
 * The module exposes fake dynamic-buffer, regular-file, and standard-stream
 * creators built on a real `stream_factory_t` and the fake adapter providers
 * supplied by the `fake_stream_adapter` module.
 *
 * Tests can therefore exercise production creator and factory paths while
 * replacing only the concrete adapter implementations with controllable fake
 * backends.
 *
 * The module also provides direct construction of `stream` instances backed
 * by caller-supplied fake adapters, allowing tests that only require a
 * `stream_t` dependency to avoid going through the factory and creator layers.
 *
 * Internal fake stream allocation storage is reset through the module reset
 * facilities so tests can start from a deterministic configuration.
 */
